{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Input｜结构图\nHero A/B1/B2与原H镜头清理已生产接入、Gate59编译；必要Camera单叶通过。正式输入／移动／Run／网络未验。\nSource唯一事实／请求，CMC唯一执行／FAILED，ASC唯一held／queued。边标签区分持有、接口调用与事实交付。\nGate54私有InputKey注入及FAILED旧红叶保留。[[Input/结构|证据与动态边界]]\n[[Input/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_输入与意图.canvas|流程图]] · [[计划_输入与意图|计划]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "action",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Enhanced Input／InputAction／Mapping Context\nUEnhancedPlayerInput：原生InputKey与映射处理。\nAction轴值／触发事件不等同真实物理释放证明。\nSubsystem.AddMappingContext／RemoveMappingContext：按原注册次数平衡持有。\n正式IMC_Default（15）／IMC_MouseLook（1）已保存CountRegistrations，原映射／过滤保持。\n仅关闭旧注册配置拒绝；Hero／Run实战未验。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOInputConfig\nNative Actions → 轴值/视角 Tag；Ability Actions → 能力 InputTag。\n用精确 Tag 匹配区分鼠标与摇杆。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 530,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "component",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOInputComponent\n按InputTag绑定原Action，返回native绑定句柄供自身会话退出解绑。\nNative值回调、Move实例回调及Ability原绑定来源分别接入；不决定GA或发行来源请求。",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHeroComponent\nInitializePlayerInput：Action／自身IMC。\n原Action观察→Receive／End原ID；Buffer／Queue固定deadline。\nB1 typed H订阅；B2原Scope装配。\nSource GetRequest证明后AddMovementInput。\nGate59编译；正式输入未验。\n[[Input/结构|接口与边界]]",
      "x": 1010,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "pc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOPlayerController｜原生执行入口\nInitInputSystem()：原配置／对象身份→原资源BeginNativeCreation→Super一次→返回重验→Complete；早退只Close原Ticket，不替换输入对象。\n私有Idle／Running／Rejected仅管理此Actor创建执行。嵌套Running明确Busy，不Super／排队；非暂态失败锁存Rejected，修依赖后重新创建，不由Tick重试。\n失效／销毁后不写阶段，诊断用入栈路径；资格归OriginResource，held／请求归PlayerInput。\nD8～D10创建侧已冻结／静态接受已Gate44编译、夹具已验／正式出生未验；默认项目PlayerInput有Record。未登记Override仍MissingConstructionWitness，正式首按未验。\nPostProcessInput(dt,paused)：原当前ASC.ProcessAbilityInput，统一本帧消费；原Getter／编队调试保持。",
      "x": 1550,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 410,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOCharacterMovementComponent\nGetMovementInputBindingSerial：读取当前消费绑定版本。\nBindMovementInputSession：expected serial比较交换，接收精确原来源。\nConsumeMovementInputFact(Binding, Fact)：验证原绑定／完整ModeProof事件，Cold一次／Rearm需Neutral；Recorded不代表执行成功。\nInvalidateMovementInputSession：仅失效匹配的原绑定。\nCMC唯一持有执行身份、移动状态与失败门禁；Acceleration只用于方向／大小，不能证明真实释放。\n[[Movement/结构]]",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 445,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "asc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent\nReceive(Tag,PreviousID,Deadline)→原请求ID。\nEnd(ID,Released/Invalidated)；Queue完整原Retry。\n唯一Spec held／queued聚合与Process执行；Retry仅带原ID／Tag／deadline。\nHero A已消费；Gate59编译，正式输入未验。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|原请求接口]]",
      "x": 1010,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 职责与实施边界\nInput观察并发行来源事实；Hero只持原观察与订阅／Scope句柄；CMC唯一执行移动及FAILED，ASC唯一能力held／queued与执行。\nHero B2已接原CMC serial→Source Begin→CMC Bind→保存原Binding→Attach；真实重建触发，不以H Ready装配。\nAbility Completed/Canceled→原请求Released；Movement Released必须真物理证明；H Released仅本地撤回；SessionInvalidated仅生命周期失效。\nCold资格不等于执行成功，异常恢复仍真释放后重按，跨Producer无转交证明拒绝。Recorded执行失败保留原请求／释放链。\nGate59编译与Camera单叶通过；Gate54注入夹具、FAILED旧失败保持。正式Hero移动、Run、硬件及网络未验；无假Neutral／默认速度／自动重试。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3730,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "playerinput",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPlayerInput : UEnhancedPlayerInput\n唯一键／设备观察者与来源号发行者，不持移动执行／FAILED。D12-A/B及后继观察拆分已编译；Hero B2已装配并随Gate59编译，正式Source／Hero动态未验。\nPostInitProperties→原资源Record：默认类已配置；出生夹具已验／Override待验。\nBeginMovementInputSession(Pawn,Component,Action)→CaptureOriginalOrigin／校验原路由→实际Session，仅Cold Claim；成功仅准备。\nAttachMovementInputReceiver(Session,Binding,Receiver)→显式Opened；未碰映射不参加、不伪Neutral／Unresolved；重复Attach不替换。\nInputKey→原生Observe→Movement Projection→Super一次→只匹配原观察/Session。真实首数字Press可Cold，异常后仍须真实释放再按。\nIssuePhysicalRequest(Proof,Session)→实际Request／Event提交→Consume原Claim→重验→Started。消费失败无Started、不复用号。\nGetMovementInputRequest→只读有效held；End仅退Movement义务，不改raw；真实Flush另记原生缺口，销毁才清设备记录。\n首次Begin前Flush仅保经Cold认证的原weak后立即Retire；新Producer无交接证明拒绝Rearm。\n[[Input/结构#原资格与真实请求发行（D12-B）|资格与发行契约]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1850,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "observer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOMovementInputRouteObserver\n同一PlayerInput头文件中的薄资源对象；由PlayerInput持有，不是新的执行器。\nInitialize(Subsystem, Pawn, Session)：订阅映射重建、控制器变化及Pawn EndPlay，回调始终携带捕获的原Session。\nDetach()：撤销原订阅，幂等释放；旧回调不能结束后继会话。\n路由失效交回PlayerInput.EndMovementInputSession；不产生真实Released，不修改CMC移动状态，不新增Tick／计时器。",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 1850,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "facts",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GGYGOMovementInputTypes.h｜中性值\nSession = 原Producer弱身份＋SessionSerial；Request = Session＋RequestSerial。\nBinding = 原Consumer弱身份＋BindingSerial＋SourceSession；Fact = Request／EventSerial／Kind／Reason／SessionMode／StartProof。\n七Kind保持；D11枚举／字段已Gate45编译：Mode仅Opened（Cold／Rearm），Proof仅Started（首按／释放再按），其它Kind Invalid。\nCMC完整ModeProof／Cold一次窗Gate48合成专项通过；Source D12-B已发行显式字段、冻结Gate49R1已编译／夹具已验／正式Source未验，不代表正式Hero首W或移动成功。\n原Binding＋Fact双参数委托；弱身份及发行号分责，无权威状态／调度。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3270,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "origin",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOMovementInputOriginResource｜Input资格资源\nD7已Gate43编译；D8～D10创建侧源码冻结已Gate44编译、夹具已验／正式出生未验；Outer原LocalPlayer，GGYGOLocalPlayer已强引用保有同一对象（D8源码冻结／已Gate44编译、夹具已验／正式出生未验），Getter不能创建或重授。只管理资格／同步创建票据，不观察物理输入，不发行Source请求或CMC执行号。\nInitializeFromPlayerAdded(Player, BeforeSuper) → 真实Added候选；NotifyPlayerRemoved／NotifyControllerChanged → 按原身份退休及关闭范围。\nBeginNativeCreation(Controller, Class) → 原栈Ticket；RecordNativeCreatedProducer → 精确构造见证；CompleteNativeCreation(Ticket, Actual) → 匹配Record／当前关系／已赋槽才登记；CloseNativeCreation(Ticket, Reason) → Actor失效仍按原票据幂等清理，旧票据不关后继。\nClaimInitialQualification(Producer, Session) → 一次认领，不是移动成功；ConsumeInitialQualification(Request) → 真实发行后消费；RetireInitialQualification → 永久退休。\nGetQualification(Producer) → Unavailable／Cold／Rearm；Rearm绝不证明物理释放。PlayerInput D12-B已接Claim／Consume／Retire，冻结但Gate49R1已编译／夹具已验／正式Source未验。PostInit与默认类已写已Gate44编译、夹具已验／正式出生未验，Source消费仅夹具有限验收；联机临时Controller初始化语义待决。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2530,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "originhost",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOLocalPlayer｜原生生命周期薄宿主\nD8源码冻结／静态接受；已Gate44编译、夹具已验／正式出生未验。\nUPROPERTY MovementInputOriginResource → 保有同一原资源；GetMovementInputOriginResource()只读，不创建／初始化／重授。\nPlayerAdded两重载 → 捕获原Controller与资源，Super一次后InitializeFromPlayerAdded。\nPlayerRemoved／BeginDestroy → Super前退休，保留原对象；重复Added不NewObject重授。\nReceivedPlayerController → 资源通知早于原生广播；SpawnPlayActor → 捕获原资源，Super后通知实际Controller，保留返回与错误。\n只转发生命周期，不保存资格阶段、held、来源／执行号；原SquadPresets缓存不变。Controller范围／PostInit均冻结已Gate44编译、夹具已验／正式出生未验；联机dummy语义待用户决定。",
      "x": 1550,
      "y": 2530,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "hero-local-asc-resource",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Hero原H订阅／派生retry资源\nPrepareLocalAbilitySystemSubscription→先持原记录，再注册typed Notice；成功不保证Ready。\nReady核原H／真实PublishedContext，只关联既有输入；Refreshed同H不重装。\nAssociateInputSessionWithLocalResource→原H＋既有输入代次／组件；FAbilityRetryBinding固定原记录/H与代次。\nReleased先撤H，输入／retry按归属释放；原镜头清理独立于有无输入，重检原槽／代次保护后继。\nReleaseLocalAbilitySystemSubscription→退原token及所属retry；不全ASC.Clear。\nGate59编译；必要无输入Camera叶通过，正式输入未验。\n[[Input/结构#Hero本地ASC身份订阅与原H清理|完整接口]] · [[Character/结构|Extension资源]]",
      "x": 1550,
      "y": 1170,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 550,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw-movement-obligation-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1550,
      "y": 1850,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 630,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## PlayerInput唯一事实／派生义务\nFPhysicalSource唯一原Key/Device raw/down、ObservedAxes、原生缺口与真实释放序列，使用唯一ObservationRevision。\nFMovementSourceObligation只持Key/Device、Participant、可空ReleaseAfterRevision／原因，不复制raw/held/轴mask。\nObservePhysicalInput→原事实副本；ProjectMovementObservation只读原表／映射／自身义务。\nBarrier／Adopt／End只改Movement义务；数字真Released或全部必要轴分量真零的证明起始须晚于边界。\n真实Flush记原生缺口，合成松键不恢复；raw历史保留至Producer销毁。\nGate59已编译。能力A观察真实Action回调／原绑定，允许Injected／Chord／Combo；Hero不读私表或另建物理held。\n[[Input/结构#原生观察与Movement义务分离|字段与接口]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "hero-movement-scope",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Hero原移动Scope／薄映射通知资源\nFGGYGOHeroMovementInputScope：原Pawn／IC／Source／Subsystem／CMC／MoveAction弱身份＋输入代次＋自身IMC注册数量；只持原Session／Binding／诊断与退休标记。\nUGGYGOHeroMovementMappingObserver：Hero UPROPERTY保有，同一Hero h/cpp；Initialize订阅真实ControlMappingsRebuilt，Detach退原订阅，回调携捕获原Scope。\nHandleMovementMappingsRebuilt：自身注册记录齐备后装配；原CMC serial→Source Begin→CMC Bind CAS→保存Binding→Attach。输入值回调不Begin。\nReceiver固定原Session／Binding／弱Scope／原CMC；GetRequest只读真held，退资源用原End／Invalidate。没有第二raw／held／Neutral／FAILED或调度器。\n[[Input/结构#Hero移动来源装配与精确退出（B2）|资源、接口与清理]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1400,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
